{"id":"n23034-1-8","stage":4,"title":"갓 · 刚","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23034-1-8-1","ko":"새우튀김 한번 드셔 보세요.","zh":"请尝尝炸虾吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새우튀김","meaning":"炸虾","explanation":"새우튀김：炸虾","readings":[{"term":"새우튀김","audio":"/audio/e68824e57c1995e81fca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63370","senseId":"1","lemma":"새우튀김","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새우튀김","audio":"/audio/e68824e57c1995e81fca.mp3"}},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}},{"text":"드셔","meaning":"用餐、吃或喝（敬语）","explanation":"들다：用餐、吃或喝（敬语）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"3","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드셔","audio":"/audio/fe4d049fb0fc0e98232c.mp3"}},{"text":"보세요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"8","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보세요","audio":"/audio/10b2f8c9f190884edd75.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e68824e57c1995e8","term":"새우튀김","zh":"炸虾","audio":"/audio/e68824e57c1995e81fca.mp3","entryId":"63370","definition":"将虾用油炸出来的食物。","pronunciation":["새우튀김"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"表示把某事当做试验来尝试。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"用餐、吃或喝（敬语）","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"57293","definition":"(尊称)吃。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"